#: docs/specifications/implementations/README.md
msgid "A component is acceptable when it meets its capability's contract and the principles; beyond that the choice belongs to the implementation. Two principles weigh most: data stays in open formats and portable ([P16]{1}), and it stays where the education authority controls it ([P21]{2}). For the health of an open-source component, use a public assessment rather than judgement alone; see [standards]{3}."
